{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Starter building model for the planner. Exact Homeland facility recipes and staffing rules may change.",
    "Continuous entries reserve one Aniimo body per active slot.",
    "Farmland and Woodland are modeled as shared intermittent workloads, not one dedicated Aniimo per plot."
